/Title (Accumulate Cash Bonuses \(if any\) At any point during policy term, you shall have the option to accumulate the Cash Bonus \(if any\). If accumulation option is chosen, then the regular cash bonus payouts will be stopped, and the cash bonus amount will be accumulated using lower of \(State Bank of India \(SBI\) savings bank interest rate + 1.50% p.a. AND SBI savings bank interest rate x 1.5 times\). The SBI savings bank interest rate will be reviewed at the end of every quarter \(i.e. on 1st April, 1st July, 1st October and 1st January every year\).)
